{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：18:25 2026-11-26 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"Carhartt WIP減價低至41折！服飾/鞋款/配件$160起 必買《星際啟示錄》男主外套/工人褲/襯衫\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7661320f3a793e998decd8bb9b1b28e8/2026-11/2024__KF_-Riddle_1__1.png\"/>\n<p>Carhartt WIP減價41折起！美國人氣品牌Carhartt WIP一向以潮流工裝服飾深受潮人喜愛，最近品牌於11月26日起與OnTheList合作，舉行網上開倉減至41折發售，最平$160即可入手多款服飾，包括《星際啟示錄》男主角所穿的Detroit Jacket、工人褲、長短袖、帽款等，客人更可享有折上折優惠，記得把握優惠價入手！</p>\n<h2>Carhartt WIP經典工裝低至41折 換季必買秋冬衛衣/冷衫</h2>\n<img alt=\"Aric Denim Cap - Blue：41折後價$160（原價$399）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2a180a7684f51c549985156f91765812/2026-11/Aric_Denim_Cap_-_Blue.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"S/S Liquid Script T-shirt - Kumquat：46折後價$180（原價$399）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f94799f26344c7a98a3e32ddf3bbad15/2026-11/S_Liquid_Script_T-shirt_-_Kumquat.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"S/S Catalogue C Logo T-shirt - Hortensia：41折後價$200（原價$499）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7e495943171629c75977d13d6d7ddd50/2026-11/S_Catalogue_C_Logo_T-shirt_-_Hortensia.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"Anglistic Beanie - Speckled Sycamore Tree：61折後價$300（原價$499）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4ceffb8262ed10df0e7855c9d02baf31/2026-11/Anglistic_Beanie_-_Speckled_Sycamore_Tree.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"Bayfield Tote - Salt：43折後價$300（原價$699）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9fb6e0190bba5fdf7c77f1c5a050fe37/2026-11/Bayfield_Tote_-_Salt.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"W S/S Sydney T-shirt - Sydney Stripe, Wax：61折後價$300（原價$499）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9f084fd35fa943e34f9f74919e6de9bd/2026-11/W_S_Sydney_T-shirt_.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"Heart Patch Sweat - Ash Heather：51折後價$400（原價$799）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c9fa4540317ad2a8a1b78e933f9623ea/2026-11/Heart_Patch_Sweat_-_Ash_Heather.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"S/S Braxton Polo - Chervil/Black：41折後價$400（原價$999）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5b7209da9715ea4269a15503c53bc208/2026-11/S_Braxton_Polo_-_Chervil_Black.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"Amour Sweatshirt - Cannoli Cream：46折後價$450（原價$999）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/696453abbf16837fd39d111d5cc6cab4/2026-11/Amour_Sweatshirt_-_Cannoli_Cream.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"Hooded Amour Sweatshirt - Black/Black：46折後價$540（原價$1,199）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f7957fb349bb00596981a276417d9ea6/2026-11/Hooded_Amour_Sweatshirt_-_Black.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"Hooded Carhartt Sweat - Ash Heather/Rondo：61折後價$600（原價$999）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da289a2ded784be5287a8dc7b15348ac/2026-11/Hooded_Carhartt_Sweat_-_Ash_Heather.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"Signature Sweater - Sycamore Tree/Dusty Rose：46折後價$630（原價$1,399）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/941f754ea324a0529d5880bd3c1294c9/2026-11/Signature_Sweater_-_Sycamore_Tree.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"W Terrell Overall - Wax/Bleach：46折後價$630（原價$1,399）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/181ee373197ef6249bbbf89446680541/2026-11/W_Terrell_Overall_-_Wax.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"Arbor Vest - Hamilton Brown：51折後價$650（原價$1,299）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1b4fe2bd3e0e439fdfbf51a917157620/2026-11/Arbor_Vest_-_Hamilton_Brown.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"Hudson Jacket - Black：51折後價$900（原價$1,799）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/20fffca5a89faf887baa998c105f0190/2026-11/Hudson_Jacket_-_Black.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"Ducks Jacket - Bourbon：42折後價$910（原價$2,199）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9253587a761e38ad3eb2f841831a157b/2026-11/Ducks_Jacket_-_Bourbon.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"Conro Shirt Jac - Camo Leo, Tamarind/Tamarind：61折後價$1,080（原價$1,799）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e800880846d13d7ec6f07a35a739043b/2026-11/Conro_Shirt_Jac_-_Camo_Leo_Tamarind.png\"/>\n<p>Carhartt WIP網上開倉特賣低至41折，包括日常百搭基本款亦在減價之列，包括Aric Denim Cap由原價$399激減至$160，人氣的經典標誌款S/S Catalogue C Logo T-Shirt亦以41折發售，只需$200便能入手。隨住近期天氣轉涼，多款衛衣、冷帽、長袖衫同樣減價發售，款式簡約的Heart Patch Sweat從原價$799減至$400，接近半價優惠；Hooded Carhartt Sweat 61折後售$600；長袖Signature Sweater冷衫從$1,399減至$630，適合大家為秋季轉季入手。</p>\n<h2>人氣電影主角同款外套半價入手</h2>\n<p>品牌人氣外套Detroit Jacket曾為電影《星際啟示錄》男主角所穿着，一向深受歡粉絲歡迎，今次減價能夠以半價優惠入手，低至$900發售。外套整體輪廓極簡俐落，同時兼顧高度機能性，搭配前襟拉鍊與胸前口袋配置，時尚實用兼備。至於Hudson Jacket同樣以接近半價發售，折後價為$900、Ducks Jacket以41折發售，從原價$2,199減至$910，相當抵買！</p>\n<p>OnTheList x Carhartt WIP優惠詳情</p>\n<ul>\n<li>日期：11月26日至12月9日</li>\n<li>時間：<br/>。VIP Premium會員：11月26日上午8:00開始<br/>。Standard會員：11月27日上午8:00開始</li>\n<li>網上減價：＞＞按此＜＜</li>\n</ul>\n<p>文:R<br/>資料及圖片來源:官方提供</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><br/> </p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T10:43:53.877505+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":845,"images":18,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T10:25:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T16:57:56.891815+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T10:37:20.347790+00:00","content_hash":"dc63551a03e39f459721a307e4a278935c087faa7f87840a641960d1d7f744af","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}